* >Natural Source Code: ERROR-COPY
* RETAILCORE - STANDARD ERROR CODE DEFINITIONS
* USED BY ALL MODULES FOR CONSISTENT ERROR HANDLING
* CREATED: 1998-03-15
* MODIFIED: 2015-08-20 - ADDED PROCUREMENT ERRORS
* MODIFIED: 2020-03-14 - ADDED PAYMENT GATEWAY ERRORS
* MODIFIED: 2022-11-05 - ADDED RETURN PROCESSING ERRORS
* -------------------------------------------------------
*
* ERROR CODE RANGES:
*   001-099  CUSTOMER ERRORS
*   100-199  PRODUCT ERRORS
*   200-299  STORE/WAREHOUSE ERRORS
*   300-399  INVENTORY ERRORS
*   400-499  ORDER ERRORS
*   500-599  PRICING ERRORS
*   600-699  PROCUREMENT ERRORS
*   700-799  PAYMENT ERRORS
*   800-899  FULFILLMENT ERRORS
*   900-999  RETURN ERRORS
*
1 ERROR-DEFINITIONS
  2 ERR-CODE              (N4)
  2 ERR-TEXT              (A80)
  2 ERR-SEVERITY          (A1)   /* I W E F */
  2 ERR-CATEGORY          (A3)   /* CUS PRD STR INV ORD PRC SUP PAY FUL RET */
*
* CUSTOMER ERRORS
*
1 ERR-CUST-NOT-FOUND      (N4) INIT <1>
1 ERR-CUST-INACTIVE        (N4) INIT <2>
1 ERR-CUST-DUPLICATE       (N4) INIT <3>
1 ERR-CUST-INVALID-TYPE    (N4) INIT <4>
1 ERR-CUST-INVALID-STATUS  (N4) INIT <5>
1 ERR-CUST-MISSING-NAME    (N4) INIT <6>
1 ERR-CUST-INVALID-EMAIL   (N4) INIT <7>
1 ERR-CUST-SUSPENDED       (N4) INIT <8>
1 ERR-CUST-NO-ADDRESS      (N4) INIT <9>
1 ERR-CUST-CREDIT-HOLD     (N4) INIT <10>
*
* PRODUCT ERRORS
*
1 ERR-PROD-NOT-FOUND       (N4) INIT <100>
1 ERR-PROD-INACTIVE        (N4) INIT <101>
1 ERR-PROD-DISCONTINUED    (N4) INIT <102>
1 ERR-PROD-INVALID-SKU     (N4) INIT <103>
1 ERR-PROD-INVALID-CAT     (N4) INIT <104>
1 ERR-PROD-DUPLICATE       (N4) INIT <105>
1 ERR-PROD-NO-PRICE        (N4) INIT <106>
1 ERR-PROD-INVALID-UOM     (N4) INIT <107>
*
* STORE/WAREHOUSE ERRORS
*
1 ERR-STORE-NOT-FOUND      (N4) INIT <200>
1 ERR-STORE-CLOSED         (N4) INIT <201>
1 ERR-STORE-INVALID        (N4) INIT <202>
1 ERR-WH-NOT-FOUND         (N4) INIT <210>
1 ERR-WH-CLOSED            (N4) INIT <211>
1 ERR-WH-FULL              (N4) INIT <212>
1 ERR-LOC-NOT-FOUND        (N4) INIT <220>
1 ERR-LOC-INVALID          (N4) INIT <221>
*
* INVENTORY ERRORS
*
1 ERR-INV-NOT-FOUND        (N4) INIT <300>
1 ERR-INV-INSUFFICIENT     (N4) INIT <301>
1 ERR-INV-ALREADY-RESERVED (N4) INIT <302>
1 ERR-INV-NO-RESERVATION   (N4) INIT <303>
1 ERR-INV-NEGATIVE         (N4) INIT <304>
1 ERR-INV-LOCKED           (N4) INIT <305>
1 ERR-INV-RECON-MISMATCH   (N4) INIT <306>
1 ERR-INV-BELOW-SAFETY     (N4) INIT <307>
1 ERR-INV-TRANSFER-FAIL    (N4) INIT <308>
1 ERR-INV-ADJ-LIMIT        (N4) INIT <309>
*
* ORDER ERRORS
*
1 ERR-ORD-NOT-FOUND        (N4) INIT <400>
1 ERR-ORD-INVALID          (N4) INIT <401>
1 ERR-ORD-DUPLICATE        (N4) INIT <402>
1 ERR-ORD-CANCELLED        (N4) INIT <403>
1 ERR-ORD-COMPLETED        (N4) INIT <404>
1 ERR-ORD-NO-LINES         (N4) INIT <405>
1 ERR-ORD-INVALID-STATUS   (N4) INIT <406>
1 ERR-ORD-INVALID-QTY      (N4) INIT <407>
1 ERR-ORD-MAX-LINES        (N4) INIT <408>
1 ERR-ORD-PRICE-MISMATCH   (N4) INIT <409>
*
* PRICING ERRORS
*
1 ERR-PRC-NOT-FOUND        (N4) INIT <500>
1 ERR-PRC-EXPIRED          (N4) INIT <501>
1 ERR-PRC-INVALID          (N4) INIT <502>
1 ERR-PROM-NOT-FOUND       (N4) INIT <510>
1 ERR-PROM-EXPIRED         (N4) INIT <511>
1 ERR-PROM-EXCLUDED        (N4) INIT <512>
1 ERR-PROM-NOT-STACKABLE   (N4) INIT <513>
1 ERR-COUPON-INVALID       (N4) INIT <520>
1 ERR-COUPON-USED          (N4) INIT <521>
1 ERR-COUPON-EXPIRED       (N4) INIT <522>
*
* PROCUREMENT ERRORS
*
1 ERR-SUPP-NOT-FOUND       (N4) INIT <600>
1 ERR-SUPP-INACTIVE        (N4) INIT <601>
1 ERR-PO-NOT-FOUND         (N4) INIT <610>
1 ERR-PO-CLOSED            (N4) INIT <611>
1 ERR-PO-DUPLICATE         (N4) INIT <612>
1 ERR-PO-INVALID-QTY       (N4) INIT <613>
1 ERR-PO-RECV-MISMATCH     (N4) INIT <614>
*
* PAYMENT ERRORS
*
1 ERR-PAY-FAILED           (N4) INIT <700>
1 ERR-PAY-DECLINED         (N4) INIT <701>
1 ERR-PAY-TIMEOUT          (N4) INIT <702>
1 ERR-PAY-INVALID-METHOD   (N4) INIT <703>
1 ERR-PAY-ALREADY-CAPTURED (N4) INIT <704>
1 ERR-PAY-NOT-AUTHORIZED   (N4) INIT <705>
1 ERR-PAY-REVERSAL-FAIL    (N4) INIT <706>
1 ERR-PAY-SETTLE-FAIL      (N4) INIT <707>
1 ERR-PAY-AMOUNT-MISMATCH  (N4) INIT <708>
*
* FULFILLMENT ERRORS
*
1 ERR-FUL-NO-LOCATION      (N4) INIT <800>
1 ERR-FUL-ALLOCATION-FAIL  (N4) INIT <801>
1 ERR-SHIP-NOT-FOUND       (N4) INIT <810>
1 ERR-SHIP-INVALID         (N4) INIT <811>
1 ERR-DELIV-FAILED         (N4) INIT <820>
*
* RETURN ERRORS
*
1 ERR-RET-NOT-FOUND        (N4) INIT <900>
1 ERR-RET-NOT-ELIGIBLE     (N4) INIT <901>
1 ERR-RET-WINDOW-EXPIRED   (N4) INIT <902>
1 ERR-RET-ALREADY-RETURNED (N4) INIT <903>
1 ERR-RET-INVALID-QTY      (N4) INIT <904>
1 ERR-RET-INSPECTION-FAIL  (N4) INIT <905>
1 ERR-RET-REFUND-FAIL      (N4) INIT <906>
*
END-DEFINE
